{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2022-chemistry-18","exam":"MDEET","year":2022,"subject":"chemistry","number":18,"points":4,"unitId":"thermo","unitLabel":"열역학·열화학","topic":"엔탈피·엔트로피·자유에너지","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["thermo","coordination","organic_rxn","stereo"],"stem":"다음 화학 반응식은 Ni2+ 착물의 리간드 치환 반응 (가)와 (나)를 \n나타낸 것이고, 표는 300K에서 반응 (가)와 (나)의 표준 반응 엔탈피\n(ΔH°)와 표준 반응 엔트로피(ΔS°)를 나타낸 것이다.\n(가) [Ni(NH3)4(H2O)2]2+(aq)+2en(aq)\n⇄[Ni(en)2(H2O)2]2+(aq)+4NH3(aq)\n(나) [Ni(NH3)6]2+(aq)+3en(aq)⇄[Ni(en)3]2+(aq)+6NH3(aq)\nΔH°(kJ)\nΔS°(J/K)\n반응\n−10\n(가)\n70\n−17\n(나)\na\n300K에서 이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 \n고른 것은? (단, en은 에틸렌다이아민이다.)\n<보 기>\nㄱ. a는 70보다 작다.\nㄴ. 반응 (가)의 표준 반응 자유 에너지(ΔG°)는 −31kJ이다.\nㄷ. [Ni(en)2(H2O)2]2+과 [Ni(en)3]2+은 모두 광학이성질체가 \n있다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06","fig-07","fig-08"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t024"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t027"]}],"answer":4,"acceptedAnswers":[4],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":29,"height":17,"region":0,"bbox":[131.5,5.261,11.6,6.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2022-chemistry-18/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":66,"height":25,"region":0,"bbox":[108.7,27.261,26.4,10.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2022-chemistry-18/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":397,"height":25,"region":0,"bbox":[19.9,46.461,158.8,10.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2022-chemistry-18/03.webp"},{"id":"